4. Audit, Compliance, Disaster Recovery, & Privacy
	Audit & Compliance: Compliance with international standards (ISO 27001, GDPR, HIPAA)
						enforced through third-party audits, granular system logs, and explicit Service Level Agreements (SLAs).
	Cloud Disaster Recovery: Replaces traditional manual backups with Backup as a Service (BaaS)
						and Disaster Recovery as a Service (DRaaS)927. Utilizes multi-zone data replication and 
						virtualization-based hardware independence to minimize Recovery Time Objectives (RTO).
	Privacy & Data Integrity: Digital signatures, automated data lifecycle policies, and regular integrity checks
						prevent unauthorized tampering during cross-border data movements9more_horiz.
